{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1350701-1001-exalted-attack-descriptions","id":1350701,"title":"1001 Exalted attack descriptions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-24T14:19:18-08:00","id":1350701,"title":"1001 Exalted attack descriptions","content":"<span style=\"color:#141414\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Describe how an Exalt attacks something. It can be against anything using any weapon. This is for inspirational purposes, and to provide a better idea of what kinds of attacks that the Exalted routinely engage in.<br /> <br /> 1. A Dawn Caste charges forward and punches the Dynast right in the stomach with all his might, sending him through five walls and landing into a food stall.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-25T01:34:36-08:00","id":1350784,"title":"","content":"2. Spider swings his daiklave to interpose his opponent's deadly blow, the strands of silk covering his blade moving as if alive to ensnare their weapon. With a skillful twist, Spider uses the sticky silk to rip the spear out of the attacker's grip, and cast it away. He strikes his own blow moments later, the peacebonded Distaff knocking the wind out of his enemy, its silken threads now moving to hold him fast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-25T04:21:28-08:00","id":1350791,"title":"","content":"3. A fist whipped out, and a <i>crack </i>filled the air as a sonic boom was formed. The fist, hardened into something more akin to stone than flesh and moving with the speed of the wind, slammed through the air into the girl's face, its passage leaving tails of sparking shining Wind Essence. It was a blow capable of crumpling a main battle tank. The fist struck the girl in the face, and she reeled back, her nose bloody and broken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-25T05:28:43-08:00","id":1350797,"title":"","content":"4. The well dressed monkey-man smashed his barrel sized mug into the face of the cheater, sending dice and cards flying in every direction. A flash of light, barely perceptible, twinkled at the moment of impact as the mortal starts convulsing in place, as if receiving countless other strikes, the last of which knocks his right eyeball outside of his skull from the sheer impact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23809-orukan","name":"Orukan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-25T08:15:52-08:00","id":1350825,"title":"","content":"5. He took aim with the lightning ballistae. The air was right, the wind measured. He aimed at the ship below gauging their speed. He focused in and released the shot, and with a clap of thunder the thunderbolt shot outwards towards the targeted ship, shearing away clouds and causing ripples in the air, until the bolt struck the target.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-26T04:27:43-08:00","id":1351012,"title":"","content":"6. &quot;You bet your--&quot; the bandit began, but he never got the chance to finish. Three Silk Stars moved so fast that Jia couldn't follow the motion at all. All she saw was a blur of green, a flash of blue-white light, a spray of red blood, and the falling body of the headless bandit. Silk completed her motion, leg sliding smoothly across the floor of the hut, arms settling into a T-shaped guard. Blood dripped from her right hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-26T11:11:49-08:00","id":1351075,"title":"","content":"7. I Wither him to gain some Initiative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm Joh